<LegalDraft title="Privacy Policy" description="Draft information about how the Insight.info service handles personal data."><h2>Information handled</h2><p>The service may process account information, project configuration, billing records, support correspondence and analytics events submitted by project owners. The exact data depends on customer configuration.</p><h2>Purposes</h2><p>Information may be used to operate and secure the service, provide analytics, administer accounts and billing, respond to support requests, and improve reliability.</p><h2>Retention and subprocessors</h2><p>Final retention periods, hosting locations, subprocessors, transfer mechanisms and controller or processor roles must be documented before publication.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>Account and project controls allow customers to manage their data. Applicable access, deletion, objection or portability rights depend on the configured legal entity and jurisdiction.</p></LegalDraft>
